#!args --selftest
# Rasterizer and kernel checks (selftest.s): random paths rendered unclipped and through many
# clip rectangles must be bit-identical inside the clip (PARGB and A8 targets); k_a8_over
# against the scalar formula for every (dst, coverage, alpha) and at every alignment.  The
# whole test runs in on_init and ends the process with exit code 0 (passed) or 1.
